fixture mend_let_go_loses_the_flame
doc BUILD.md s6 Flame: Mend is "interruptible, the Flame is lost if interrupted": letting go on the channel's frame 31 ends it.
room test/flat
option flame 33
option hearts 4
frames 80
input
  0..29 mend
end
expect
  at 29 spell=mend
  at 30 spell=none hearts=4 flame=0
  never 0..79 hearts=5
end
